Z||000000||TN Fieros||06-03-2001||06:37 PM||||What a great idea, Cliff! With more and more Fiero clubs getting started, this will be a great help in getting everyone in touch.<P>The newest thing we have going on is the big all-Pontiac show coming up in Pigeon Forge on the 15-16th of this month. Of course, this is not OUR show, we are just lucky that it is in our state.<P>We do plan to have quite a few of our members there and everyone on the forum is invited to get together with us. We plan to take over a parking lot somewhere on the strip and fill it with Fieros one, or maybe both nights. Time and location will be posted here around the 13th of the month as details are worked out. Hope to meet lots of new people there as well as get re-acquainted with old friends.<P>A link to our page is below the graphic below.<P>Thanks,<BR>Dale (Songman)<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TNFiero[1].gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A><p>[This message has been edited by TN Fieros (edited 06-03-2001).]||||reg||14
Z||000001||Bob Englert||06-05-2001||08:15 AM||||Dale:<P>Where do you plan to be during the day on Saturday?  Are many of your members planning to enter their cars in the show?  I will be driving over on Saturday morning with Jack Cooke, but I don't plan to enter my car in the show (not show ready).<P>I am planning to stay in Knoxville Saturday evening and drive through Deals Gap Sunday morning.  Is anyone interested in making the run with me?<P><BR>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl<p>[This message has been edited by Bob Englert (edited 06-05-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||TN Fieros||06-05-2001||12:04 PM||||Bob, as far as I know, no one in our group is planning on entering. James from Memphis has the museum Indy he bought, but I am not sure if he is even going.<P>I think we just plan to look, and cruise, and meet people. Staying in Gatlinburg for the most part. I'll post more here as I find out details.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TNFiero[1].gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000003||spideyfoot||06-06-2001||07:17 PM||||Dale and I will be entering the primer class. Going to be tough this year. The trophy comes in a box and you have to finish assembling it.||||reg||1
